; ---- Apotheosis: GPU compositing symbols (gpuPrepare/gpuPresent/gpuCompositeReadback
; in WebCoreDriver.cpp). These four lack upstream WEBCORE_EXPORT, so before they were
; listed here they were the ONLY reason WebCoreFull.lib had to stay in the harness link.
; That archive then dragged GLContext/BitmapTexture/TextureMapper objects and their whole
; transitive closure into the exe, giving every function-local static in them a second
; copy independent of the DLL's -- the same duplicate-state class of bug as the earlier
; BUILDING_WebCore/dllimport defect. Exporting them lets the harness drop the archive.
??0BitmapTexture@WebCore@@AAA@ABVIntSize@1@V?$OptionSet@W4Flags@BitmapTexture@WebCore@@$0A@@WTF@@@Z
?clearColor@TextureMapper@WebCore@@QAAXABVColor@2@@Z
?createOffscreen@GLContext@WebCore@@SA?AV?$unique_ptr@VGLContext@WebCore@@U?$default_delete@VGLContext@WebCore@@@std@@@std@@AAVPlatformDisplay@2@@Z
?setBackgroundColor@GraphicsLayerTextureMapper@WebCore@@UAAXABVColor@2@@Z

